{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34406","headline":"奉和袭美夏景无事因怀章来二上人次韵 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美夏景无事因怀章来二上人次韵 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽忆高僧坐夏堂，厌泉声闹笑云忙。\n山重海澹怀中印，月冷风微宿上方。\n病後书求嵩少药，定回衣染贝多香。\n何时更问逍遥义，五粒松阴半石牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}